EnergyCommunity.deployment

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Coordinates component lifecycle, startup orchestration, and runtime health monitoring across services.
- Manages dependency initialization order (ensuring data stores and messaging channels are verified healthy before dependent services start).
- Handles graceful shutdown and resource cleanup on system termination.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: ORCHESTRATION / INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER.
- Boundary Rule: Drives system bootstrapping via lifecycle and management interfaces provided by core components, without coupling directly to private component internals.
- Containerization rules remain separate from application-level lifecycle orchestration.
